cells:
  - kind: 1
    languageId: markdown
    value: "Today we learn about windows function part 2        \r

      In the previous lecture we learn the 8 window functions\r

      Today we learn extra features about windows functions       \r

      aor hum sika ga ki kasa huma important mathmatical functions ko calcuate
      kar sakta ha using windows function"
    metadata: {}
  - kind: 1
    languageId: markdown
    value: if you want to became Data analyst then windows functions are very
      important . because windows functiona re analyatical functions
    metadata: {}
  - kind: 1
    languageId: markdown
    value: "# Ranking\r

      yadi apko kisi categorical variable ka andr ranking karwani hoti ha tho
      aap windows functions use kar sakto\r

      example apka paas data ha \r

      - customer = name of the cusotmer\r

      - state = vo konsa state sa ha \r

      - purchase - kitna rupees ka saman usna karidya     \r

      you can ask Question : muja har state ka top 5 customer nikalana ha
      jinhona sabasa jada saman karida"
    metadata: {}
  - kind: 1
    languageId: markdown
    value: "ya fir          \r

      kisi departemnt ka top emplyess nikal kar do        \r

      kisi branch ka top students nika kar do\r

      kisi ipl team ka top batsman nikal kar do           \r

      is thara ka questions ko aap solve karta ho using ranking       \r

      sir ek question kar ka dikary tho humko pata chal jayega"
    metadata: {}
