  - kind: 1
    languageId: markdown
    value: the second mathematical quantity jo easily calcuate kar sakt ha
      cummulative sum
    metadata: {}
  - kind: 1
    languageId: markdown
    value: "# Cummulative Sum\r

      A Cummulative sum calcuates the Sum of a set of values up to a give point
      in time ,and inculades all previous values in the
      calucations.            \r

      aap move karta jat ho aga aor picha ki values ka sum karta raheta ho"
    metadata: {}
  - kind: 1
    languageId: markdown
    value: "exmaple apka paas data ha apki website par per day kitna regirstration
      ho raha ha .         \r

      date    number of registraion\r

      -       250\r

      -       100\r

      -       \r

      -       1000\r

      aap question puch sakta ho . konsi date ko hamra 1000 regirstion croos hua
      . ya iska ulta bhi .ya aap tabhi bata paho ga jab apka paas sum hoga"
    metadata: {}
  - kind: 2
    languageId: sql
    value: "-- virat kohil na apna 50th,100th,200th match ma kitna run banya tha\r

      -- aap isa directly bhi nikal sakta tha lakin huma isa solve karega \r

      -- through cummulative sum"
    metadata: {}
